WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.820
In 1918, there was this huge Navy ship that
was carrying 300 men.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:07.880
It was headed to Baltimore and it went right
through this stretch of water called the Bermuda

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:08.880
Triangle.

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:09.880
You've maybe heard of it before.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.340
But the ship never arrived to Baltimore.

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:15.690
Despite being able to, the ship never sent
out an S.O.S.

00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:16.690
distress call.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.210
No wreck was ever found.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:20.140
300 men gone.

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:23.830
The Navy literally came out and said that
this disappearance was “one of the most

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.990
baffling mysteries in the annals of the Navy.”

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.180
That's an official quote.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:31.439
This is just one of over 70 mysterious disappearances.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:35.230
Hundreds of people vanished in this one little
stretch of water.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:37.110
I wanted to know what was going on here.

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:40.000
So I did a big, deep dive into the Bermuda
Triangle.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.800
And what I learned was kind of surprising.

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.289
Go ahead and check it out on my channel.

